        "node_id": "n_8_ad8705",
        "thought_text": "Iterate through all possible pairs of points and check if they can form a right triangle with any other point. If the difference in x-coordinates or y-coordinates is zero for any pair, skip it since it cannot form a right triangle. Count the valid triangles.",
